t/lib/TestSSHD.pm writes "Subsystem sftp ..." whenever it finds an sftp-server binary, so the box under test has SFTP -- which is not the environment this distribution exists for. has_sftp is already exposed.

Add a variant that runs sshd without the subsystem and asserts the operations succeed anyway. Today the suite proves the exec paths work, not that SFTP is unnecessary.
